{
  "_contract": [
    "Turkish language pack. Loaded in addition to patterns.json when present.",
    "Same contract: patterns match the FOLDED message (lowercased, reduced to ASCII), so they",
    "are written without Turkish letters — write 'kullanici', never 'kullanici' with dotless i,",
    "otherwise the pattern never matches.",
    "Useful when commit messages are occasionally written in Turkish out of habit even though",
    "the spec asks for English.",
    "Direction matters: a forbidden reference has the USER as the speaker. The dative form",
    "('kullaniciya soyledikleri' = what the app tells the user) is UI copy, not a reference,",
    "and is excluded. 'duzeltme:' is not a narrative frame here: in Turkish the word means",
    "both 'correction' and 'fix', and its technical sense is a legitimate body label.",
    "foreign_markers: each entry must be word-bounded and at least three letters. Measured:",
    "unbounded markers matched all 20 English control messages (ve->have, de->code, da->update);",
    "'once' (Turkish 'once' folds onto the English word) and the -ndi suffix (Hindi, Burundi)",
    "were dropped for the same reason. What remains scores 0 of 20 English controls and flags",
    "39% of 551 Turkish commits. Subject-only recall is 11%: a one-line message often carries",
    "no marker, so this warns, it does not enforce."
  ],
  "hard": [
    {
      "pattern": "kullanici(?!ya|lara)[^.\\n]{0,80}\\b(sordu|dedi|soyledi|bildirdi|istedi|itiraz)",
      "label": "conversation reference, TR (kullanici ... sordu/dedi/bildirdi)"
    },
    {
      "pattern": "kullanici\\s*(nin|nun)?\\s+(sorusu|bildirimi|raporu|karari|talebi|gozlemi|incelemesi|istegi|itirazi)",
      "label": "conversation reference, TR (kullanici sorusu/bildirimi/karari ...)"
    },
    {
      "pattern": "\\burun karari\\b",
      "label": "attribution, TR ('urun karari')"
    },
    {
      "pattern": "(?m)^\\s*soru\\s*:",
      "label": "narrative frame, TR (SORU:)"
    },
    {
      "pattern": "\\bdemistim\\b",
      "label": "narrative frame, TR ('...demistim')"
    },
    {
      "pattern": "\\bdegerlendirmem\\b|\\bdogru hatirliyor\\b",
      "label": "first-person narrative, TR"
    }
  ],
  "soft": [
    {
      "pattern": "\\b(yaptim|olctum|baktim|gordum|denedim|kovaladim|sandim|dusundum|ekledim|buldum|sectim|yazdim|anladim|karar verdim|fark ettim)\\b",
      "label": "first person singular, TR"
    }
  ],
